                      "outcome_text": "know regional cooperation and give examples. (u, gs)",
                      "domain": "Understanding/Generic Skills"
                    },
                    {
                      "outcome_text": "appreciate the benefits of regional cooperation. (u, v, s)",
                      "domain": "Understanding/Values/Skills"
                    },
                    {
                      "outcome_text": "understand the challenges faced by regional cooperation. (u, gs)",
