                      "description": "Learners should compare regional cooperations to other kinds of businesses and make some charts to explain the differences and similarities."
                    },
                    {
                      "activity_type": "Presentation/Radio Show",
                      "description": "Learners should make links between regional cooperations and international trade, presenting their findings by composing a possible radio show for an educational radio station."
                    }
                  ],
                  "suggested_assessment_activities": [
                    {
                      "assessment_type": "Advertisement",
                      "description": "Learners work together to produce an advert for regional cooperation. Observe how well the advert highlights important features of regional cooperation."
                    },
                    {
                      "assessment_type": "Conversation",
                      "description": "In conversation with learners, ask them to explain what they think the benefits are of regional cooperations to the wider national economy."
